    "created_at": "2018-01-22T00:37:02Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-01-22T00:37:02Z",
    "body": "I think it'd still be a good idea to add this here as it's a non-normative change that makes things easier to understand while reading the spec. (And also easier for any implementations like Servo or jsdom that implement it exactly.)\r\n\r\nWe could separately add a warning about #221 and #278, but I'd like to see this merged if possible.",
